         Microsoft.CrmSdk.CoreAssemblies) up to the fixed 6.0.x patch. This net462 plugin graph is
         outside Spaarke.sln / CI / the net10-scoped task-032 CVE gate, so the fix is pinned here
         explicitly. Scoped to this net462 island ONLY — do NOT re-pin STJ on the net10 graph
         (framework-provided, NU1510). See workstreams/plugins/design.md D8-01 (r3 task 032). -->
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="6.0.11" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
